        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>431</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>EmailSubject</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Thank You for Your Donation - CVMA Chapter 20-7</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>EmailBody</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Dear {!ContactRecord.FirstName},

Thank you for your generous donation to the Combat Veterans Motorcycle Association Chapter 20-7!

DONATION DETAILS:
- Donation Amount: ${!DonationRecord.Amount}
- Date: {!DonationRecord.CloseDate}
- Campaign: {!DonationRecord.CampaignId}
- Receipt ID: {!DonationRecord.Name}

YOUR IMPACT:
Your contribution directly supports our "Vets Serving Vets" mission through:
• Veteran support services and emergency assistance
• Community outreach and charity events
• Chapter operations and meeting expenses
• Motorcycle safety and riding education
• Brotherhood activities and family support

FINANCIAL TRANSPARENCY:
We are committed to responsible stewardship of your donation:
- 85% goes directly to veteran services and programs
- 10% supports chapter operations and facilities
- 5% covers administrative and fundraising costs

TAX INFORMATION:
CVMA Chapter 20-7 is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.
Tax ID: XX-XXXXXXX
This donation is tax-deductible to the full extent allowed by law.
Please keep this email as your donation receipt.

STAY CONNECTED:
- Website: www.cvma20-7.org
- Mobile App: Access through Salesforce mobile app
- Social Media: Follow our chapter activities and updates
- Email: info@cvma20-7.org

UPCOMING OPPORTUNITIES:
Watch for information about upcoming fundraising events and volunteer opportunities where you can further support our veteran community.

Thank you for standing with our combat veterans!

Vets Serving Vets
Combat Veterans Motorcycle Association
Chapter 20-7 - Jacksonville, FL

"Honor the Fallen, Help the Living"

This is an automated donation acknowledgment. For questions, please contact finance@cvma20-7.org</stringValue>
            </value>
